# Frontend rules

Before planning or implementing frontend work, read:
- `spec/00-shared-architecture-directives.md`
- `spec/06-frontend-architecture-directives.md`

## Stack

React 19.2.3, Expo SDK 56, Expo Router v4+, TypeScript.

## Layering

Presentation (`app/`, components) → Domain (hooks, providers) → Data (api, cache, storage). No network logic in presentational components. Tokens only via `expo-secure-store`.

## React 19

Prefer actions: `useActionState`, `useFormStatus`, `useOptimistic`. Use TanStack Query for server state where appropriate.

## Tests

Follow `spec/07-monorepo-testing-strategy.md` (unit / component / e2e).
